 payload←Static req;ep;name;ct
⍝ Serve a bundled Swagger UI asset from assets/swagger-ui/.
 :If req≡'CSS⍠SPEC'
     payload←(
         tags:,⊂'Web UI' ⋄ summary:'Swagger UI stylesheet' ⋄ operationId:'getSwaggerCss' ⋄ security:⍬
         responses:(⍙200:(description:'CSS'))
     )
     :Return
 :ElseIf req≡'THEME⍠SPEC'
     payload←(
         tags:,⊂'Web UI' ⋄ summary:'Dyalog theme stylesheet' ⋄ operationId:'getThemeCss' ⋄ security:⍬
         responses:(⍙200:(description:'CSS'))
     )
     :Return
 :ElseIf req≡'JS⍠SPEC'
     payload←(
         tags:,⊂'Web UI' ⋄ summary:'Swagger UI script bundle' ⋄ operationId:'getSwaggerBundle' ⋄ security:⍬
         responses:(⍙200:(description:'JavaScript'))
     )
     :Return
 :EndIf
 ep←req.Endpoint
 name←⊃⌽'/'(≠⊆⊢)ep                         ⍝ last path segment, e.g. 'swagger-ui.css'
⍝ Allow-list: only known assets, each with its content type. Anything else → 404.
 ct←''
 :Select name
     :Case 'swagger-ui.css'       ⋄ ct←'text/css; charset=utf-8'
     :Case 'theme.css'            ⋄ ct←'text/css; charset=utf-8'
     :Case 'swagger-ui-bundle.js' ⋄ ct←'application/javascript; charset=utf-8'
 :EndSelect
 :If 0∊⍴ct
     ⎕SIGNAL⊂('EN' 404)('Vendor' 'DCMS')('Message' 'Not found')   ⍝ HandleError builds the envelope
 :EndIf
 'content-type' req.SetHeader ct
 payload←(##.GLOBAL.web_asset_names⍳⊂name)⊃##.GLOBAL.web_assets   ⍝ cached byte payload (see Run.apf)
